<div id="projects" class="container">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-8 mx-auto">
      <h3>Projects</h3>
      <hr class="style-one">
      <br>
      <br>
      <div class="container-fluid">

        <div class="card-deck">

          <div class="card text-center">
            <div class="ribbon ribbon-orange">
              <span>Personal</span>
            </div>
            <img class="card-img-top" src="/assets/images/housing.jpg" alt="Housing App">
            <div class="card-body">
              <hr class="style-three">
              <h4 class="card-title">Housing App</h4>
              <p class="card-text">
                Currently working on a Housing app for the Graduate
                Indian Students at GMU. It is an Angular based web
                app and backend is being developed in node.js/ExpressJS
                with MongoDB. This app is developed in collaboration with
                <a href="http://www.jaypalan.com/">Jay Palan</a>
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-footer">
              <a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="http://igsahousing.com/" class="btn btn-primary">
                Visit <i class="fa fa-home"></i>
              </a>
              <a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/dhoshya/housing-angular" class="btn btn-primary">
                Github <i class="icon fa fa-github"></i>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card text-center">
            <div class="ribbon ribbon-blue">
              <span>Academic</span>
            </div>
            <img class="card-img-top" src="/assets/images/cs688.png" alt="Handwritten Digit Recognition">
            <div class="card-body">
              <hr class="style-three">
              <h4 class="card-title">Handwritten Digit Recognition</h4>
              <p class="card-text">As the course requirement
                for Pattern Recognition, Digit Recognition was
                performed using TensorFlow and Python at 98.9% accuracy</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-footer">
              <a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/dhoshya/CS-688" class="btn btn-primary">
                Github <i class="icon fa fa-github"></i>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card text-center" id="tl-igsa">
            <div class="ribbon ribbon-orange">
              <span>Personal</span>
            </div>
            <img class="card-img-top" src="/assets/images/igsagmu.jpg" alt="IGSA Website">
            <div class="card-body">
              <hr class="style-three">
              <h4 class="card-title">IGSA Website</h4>
              <p class="card-text">
                As the Vice-President of the association, decision to
                revamp the existing website was taken. The new responsive
                website is developed using WordPress.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-footer">
              <a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="http://igsagmu.org" class="btn btn-primary">Visit</a>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="container">
          <div class="card-deck">

            <div class="card text-center">
              <div class="ribbon ribbon-black">
                <span style="color: black">Internship</span>
              </div>
              <img class="card-img-top" src="/assets/images/header.jpg" alt="Face Detection">
              <div class="card-body">
                <hr class="style-three">
                <h4 class="card-title">Face Detection and Gender Recognition</h4>
                <p class="card-text">
                  A solution to the real-time detection of faces was developed
                  using C++ and OpenCV Libraries. The program was given a
                  training set of about 100 faces. I was in-charge of feature
                  extraction of the input faces and used Viola - Jones Technique
                  with AdaBoost Learning Algorithm to reach to the conclusion.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card text-center">
              <div class="ribbon ribbon-orange">
                <span>Personal</span>
              </div>
              <img class="card-img-top" src="/assets/images/header.jpg" alt="Static Portfolio">
              <div class="card-body">
                <hr class="style-three">
                <h4 class="card-title">Static Portfolio</h4>
                <p class="card-text">
                  The site you are on right now, developed using advanced
                  HTML, CSS and Bootstrap 4. ParticlesJS is used as the
                  background.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="card-footer">
                <a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/dhoshya/static-portfolio" class="btn btn-primary">
                  Github <i class="icon fa fa-github"></i>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card text-center">
              <div class="ribbon ribbon-black">
                <span style="color: black">Internship</span>
              </div>
              <img class="card-img-top" src="/assets/images/header.jpg" alt="SAN Analysis">
              <div class="card-body">
                <hr class="style-three">
                <h4 class="card-title">SAN Analysis</h4>
                <p class="card-text">
                  This project was basically to analyze the internal
                  System Area Network of the Technical University of Sofia.
                  The network packets were analyzed using OMNET++. The effects
                  on latency were studied and reported after changing different
                  parameters of the network.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="container">
          <div class="card-deck">

            <div class="card text-center">
              <div class="ribbon ribbon-blue">
                <span>Academic</span>
              </div>
              <img class="card-img-top" src="/assets/images/header.jpg" alt="Bluff Card Game">
              <div class="card-body">
                <hr class="style-three">
                <h4 class="card-title">Bluff Card Game</h4>
                <p class="card-text">
                  As the course requirement for Secure Software Design,
                  we developed a card game. The basic objective of this
                  project was to implement security features to the game
                  using SSL/TLS. The project was completed using Java,
                  JSF, Hibernate, MySQL and the front side was designed using
                  HTML/CSS/JS.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card text-center">
              <div class="ribbon ribbon-blue">
                <span>Academic</span>
              </div>
              <img class="card-img-top" src="/assets/images/header.jpg" alt="Undergrad Thesis">
              <div class="card-body">
                <hr class="style-three">
                <h4 class="card-title">Undergrad Thesis</h4>
                <h5 class="card-title">SKN Digitisation</h5>
                <p class="card-text">
                  Along with my team I developed a website for the department of
                  computer science in our college using Joomla v3.4 framework.
                  I chose this as my thesis to bridge the increasing gap between
                  the faculty and students. Services like Online Notice, Online Feedback,
                  Documents Repository etc. were implemented.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card text-center">
              <div class="ribbon ribbon-blue">
                <span>Academic</span>
              </div>
              <img class="card-img-top" src="/assets/images/header.jpg" alt="Customer Survey Web App">
              <div class="card-body">
                <hr class="style-three">
                <h4 class="card-title">Customer Survey Web App</h4>
                <p class="card-text">
                  Developed survey database web application to store customer data,
                  survey answers and featured listing of customers with options to
                  search, add, remove a record. REST API's were created for zip code.
                  JSF2.2, Primefaces, SQL, JPA and JAX-RS were used.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
